  "intro": {
    "title": "Twenty-one is one-and-twenty",
    "paragraphs": [
      "German numbers up to twelve are just words to learn. From thirteen on, they follow a pattern, and the one surprise is that from 21 to 99 the ones come first: einundzwanzig is 'one-and-twenty', siebenundvierzig is 'seven-and-forty'.",
      "Big numbers are written as one long word: 365 is dreihundertfünfundsechzig. Nobody writes it out in real life, but you need to hear it that way."
    ]
  },
